 "distinctiveness": [
  "Copper and verdigris carry the identity; use copper boldly in a few places (headline accent, hero plate) rather than as small accents everywhere.",
  "Carry the plate apparatus (rulers, plate codes, scan line, hatching) into page UI so the system reads as an instrument, not clean SaaS on paper.",
  "Avoid category-default patterns: big-number tiles over a mono caption row, dark 'extraction' text blocks, numbered section eyebrows, red/green status dots without a word.",
  "Make time the subject: show when something was caught, not just what a file contains."
 ]
}